            "review_title": "Review at Mạnh",
            "review_text": "Sơn N\n1 contribution\n0\nRecommend\nJul 2025 • Solo\nDelicious and Peaceful Vegetarian Spot!\nI had a fantastic meal at this vegetarian restaurant. The food was fresh, full of flavor, and beautifully presented. I loved the variety of plant-based options on the menu. The staff were kind, helpful, and made us feel welcome from the moment we arrived. The ambiance was calm and relaxing — a perfect place to enjoy a healthy, satisfying meal. Even if you’re not vegetarian, you’ll still appreciate the quality and taste. I’ll definitely return and recommend this place to my friends. A true gem for anyone who enjoys good food!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 6, 2025",
